    "title": "打印销售单列表",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%8D%95%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F\" tabindex=\"-1\">设置销售单列表打印样式<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%8D%95%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>点击设置-打印设置-选择销售单列表模板</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/530342fca50f1d54b6f7b754cabaceed.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>点击表格，右侧信息设置-列设置，可以勾选要打印的信息。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/9da77f7bb65162d5ba7ffa7e7455d7b0.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%8D%95%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8\" tabindex=\"-1\">打印销售单列表<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%8D%95%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>点击左侧栏销售-销售-打印列表。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/2febadebb164baa932cee77202b9cead.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>可以预览效果，然后点击打印即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/639dcf5fb8d5aba15ab0ce639946cd0c.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
